    "updated_at": "2016-01-31T11:07:55Z",
    "body": "Well, \"trusted\" is already linked in this definition even though it's linked in the definition immediately preceding this one. So I should think that, in this definition, either _both_ or _neither_ of the terms \"trusted\" & \"dispatched\" should be linked.\n\n(Or yes, you might argue that \"dispatched\" shouldn't be linked in either definition, but personally I found the link to be helpful when tracing an execution path thru the specs just now.)\n",
